# Create graphs
CreateGraph graph1
CreateGraph graph2

# Add nodes to the graphs
AddNode graph1 n1
AddNode graph1 n2
AddNode graph2 n3
AddNode graph2 n4

# Add edges to the graphs
AddEdge graph1 n1 n2 e1
AddEdge graph2 n3 n4 e2

# Print the nodes in the graphs
ListNodes graph1
ListNodes graph2

# Print the outgoing edges in the graphs
ListChildren graph1 n1
ListChildren graph2 n3